  "historyNote": "#6662, eff 12-25-97; ss by #8526, eff 12-21-05; ss by #10536, eff 3-6-14; amd by #13049, eff 6-4-20 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 1000); ss by #13817, eff 12-1-23 (formerly Rev 1008.03) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 1000)",
